==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card features the [[Alolan form]] of {{p|Vulpix}}.
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Burning Shadows|Alolan Vulpix|27}} from the {{TCG|Burning Shadows}} expansion.
*This card's {{TCGP|Promo-B}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Cosmic Eclipse|Alolan Vulpix|39}} from the {{TCG|Cosmic Eclipse}} expansion; both cards have the Gnaw attack.
*'''Gnaw''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Base Set|Pikachu|58}} from the {{TCG|Base Set}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

